  "prefLabel": "Plc 607.06 Renewal Licenses: Issuance and Duration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 607.06 Renewal Licenses: Issuance and Duration.\n\n(a) The OPLC shall issue body art practitioner licenses in accordance with Plc 308.13(a).\n\n(b) Renewal licenses shall be valid as provided in Plc 308.13(b).\n\nSource. #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36",
